<title>PHILIPPINES: Basketball-Philippine pro-league results.</title>
<headline>Basketball-Philippine pro-league results.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of elimination round games on Tuesday in the Philippine Basketball Association third conference, which includes American imports:</p>
<p>Mobiline Cellulars beat Purefoods Cowboys 127-92 (55-41)</p>
<p>Ginebra San Miguel beat Alaska Milk 97-83 (38-41)</p>
